{"id":137806505974682,"name":"[UPDATE] Mount Cow","desc":"\nMount Cow\nSelamat datang di dunia penuh petualangan bertema sapi yang seru dan unik! Di sini kamu bisa menjelajah berbagai tantangan, menikmati fitur keren, dan bersenang-senang bersama teman.\n\n✨ Fitur Utama:\n\n👥 Nikmati fitur Carry/Gendong untuk membawa temanmu kemana saja, bahkan sambil berpetualang.\n🕺 Gunakan emote & dance untuk seru-seruan bareng player lain.\n🌞🌙 Nikmati mode Siang & Malam yang bisa kamu atur sesuka hati.\n🏁 Taklukkan 13 checkpoint yang menantang dan uji ketangkasanmu.\n🎶 Putar musik favoritmu dengan sistem Playlist, pilih lagu yang kamu suka untuk menemani petualanganmu!\n⚡ Gunakan Speed Coil untuk berlari super cepat dan menjelajahi.\n\n⚠ Catatan: Game ini masih dalam tahap pengembangan, jadi akan ada update baru secara berkala dengan fitur tambahan, perbaikan, dan tantangan baru. Jangan lupa untuk kembali dan lihat apa yang baru di Mount Cow! 🚀\n","path":"/game/137806505974682-update-mount-cow","slug":"137806505974682-update-mount-cow","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/552caf7d35933a94cdd0c28557c8b0476f353f3b2752a07d818dcc0118cef536.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-42abcf3b1ae3ebd266269d4ccf49b05c/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":1801293,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-10-10T08:10:44.151Z","creator":{"name":"xxaveecy","type":"User"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"UPDATE-Mount-Cow-ArceusXArchive-57429","_id":"68e8bf8436e016849880941f","title":"ArceusXArchive","game":{"_id":"68e8bf8436e016849880941c","gameId":137806505974682,"name":"[UPDATE] Mount Cow","imageUrl":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":137806505974682},"features":"Feature\nAuto Checkpoints","tags":[],"script":"script_key=\"yourkey\";\nloadstring(game:HttpGet(\"http